{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1120305001:0":{"text":"ごめん、アルサ、ゲホゲホッ、お姉ちゃん……僕、やっぱり……ゲホゲホッ！","source_cn":"对不起，阿尔萨，咳咳，姐姐……我还是……咳咳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE24D1748766E92E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120305002:0":{"text":"薬を飲んだのに、なんで全然よくならないんだろう……","source_cn":"明明已经吃了药，为什么病情还是没有好转……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EB243C3F9F2BA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120305003:1":{"text":"うーん、もしかして、まだ効き目が現れる時間じゃないのかな？","source_cn":"呃，难道是还没到起效的时间？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EFEB98B94A0BB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120305004:1":{"text":"おバカロンロン、薬を飲んでから時間が経ってるんだから、とっくに効果が出てるはずよ！","source_cn":"笨蛋满满，药都喝了这么久了，早就该起作用了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38FEADAD863710FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120305005:0":{"text":"どうしよう……こういう薬草を使う以外の治療法を知らないよ……","source_cn":"怎么办……除了这种草药，我不知道其他治疗的办法了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A51353F9C950119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120305006:0":{"text":"全部僕のせいだ、僕が早く気づいていれば……僕がいけないんだ……","source_cn":"都怪我，如果我早点发现问题就好了……都是我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD31311931EBE5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1120305006":{"text":"全部僕のせいだ、僕が早く気づいていれば……僕がいけないんだ……","source_cn":"都怪我，如果我早点发现问题就好了……都是我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD31311931EBE5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120305007:1":{"text":"そうだね、今焦ったってしょうがないし……ごめん、どうかしてたよ。","source_cn":"你说得对，我现在着急也没有用……抱歉，是我急昏头了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49997F3FF46AFA5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120305008:1":{"text":"大丈夫ですよ！前にアルサさんが毒ナイフにやられて倒れちゃった時は、みんなもすっごく焦ってましたから！","source_cn":"没关系！之前阿尔萨被毒匕首刺伤晕倒的时候，大家也是这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x772BA3843884A28F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120305009:1":{"text":"毒ナイフ……倒れる……","source_cn":"毒匕首……晕倒……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6368832246413809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120305010:1":{"text":"そういえば、前に僕が戦歌祭で怪我を負った時は誰が治してくれたの？","source_cn":"说起来，之前我在战歌节上受伤的那次，是谁把我治好的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25C74D04548ADFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120305011:1":{"text":"アクンって名前のミーアキャットだ。あいつは薬作りが得意みたいだな。","source_cn":"那只叫阿熏的狐獴。他好像很擅长制药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3193B23195DE212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120305012:1":{"text":"もし本当にそうなら、この子のために薬を作ってもらえないかな……","source_cn":"如果他真的这么厉害的话，不知道能不能帮帮这孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F11DEAB7DB5B5DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1120305012":{"text":"もし本当にそうなら、この子のために薬を作ってもらえないかな……","source_cn":"如果他真的这么厉害的话，不知道能不能帮帮这孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F11DEAB7DB5B5DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120305013:1":{"text":"あぁ、オレもそう思う。","source_cn":"嗯，我也这么觉得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x722E484FBF2CBDDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120305015:1":{"text":"うーん……でも、そのアクンはどこにいるんだろう。","source_cn":"唔……可是，我们现在要去哪里找到这位阿熏呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76FA3B785D49A903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120305016:1":{"text":"確か、戦歌祭ではマンカラがあいつを連れてきてたな。彼女に聞いてみるか。","source_cn":"我记得之前在战歌节上，是曼卡拉把他带过来的。我们可以找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA55636F05C904BA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120305017:1":{"text":"うん。この子をこれ以上このままにしておくわけにもいかないしね。","source_cn":"好。这孩子的病情应该也不能再耽误了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4861CAC57D35E985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120305018:0":{"text":"ゲホッ、ゲホゲホッ……うぅ……アルサお姉ちゃん、どこに行くの……","source_cn":"咳、咳咳……呜……阿尔萨姐姐，你们要去哪里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8765F884218F1637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1120305019:0":{"text":"薬を探してくるよ。それを飲めばきっとすぐによくなるから。","source_cn":"乖孩子，我们要去帮你找药。吃下那种药，你就会好起来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61CECDB565B3BD36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1120305020:0":{"text":"だから僕たちが戻ってくるまで、どんなにつらくても頑張るんだよ？","source_cn":"所以在我们回来之前，不管多难受你都要坚持住，好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B2D9954D90C3B69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1120305021:1":{"text":"他の人に君のお世話を頼んでおくからね。","source_cn":"我会拜托其他人好好照顾你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D21DD8A5E9F19B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1120305022:0":{"text":"分かった！ゲホッ、ゲホッ……アルサお姉ちゃん、信じてるよ！僕、いい子で待ってる！","source_cn":"好！咳，咳……我相信阿尔萨姐姐！我会乖乖等你们回来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE444E6A0A443162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1120305023:1":{"text":"……この子をこのままにしておいてはいけませんね。","source_cn":"……这孩子的情况，应该不能再拖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0191736D40B772B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1120305024:1":{"text":"うん。今すぐ武闘場に行ってマンカラさんを捜そう！","source_cn":"嗯。事不宜迟，我们赶紧去武斗场找曼卡拉吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3085D95B8085C95C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"試してみる価値はあるな。","source_cn":"值得一试。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE91C4C16D8687F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"試してみる価値はあるな。","female":"試してみる価値はあるわね。","variant_male_record_index":"63362","variant_female_record_index":"63363","docu